.space-y-6
	PageHead(title="Mail log" subtitle!="{data.provider === 'aiosis' ? 'Sending through Aiosis Emails from signup@, signin@, notification@ and contact@ (Settings → Email). It delivers only to addresses verified on the Aiosis account.' : data.provider === 'missing' ? 'Mail cannot be sent.' : 'Dev mode without AIOSIS_API_KEY: messages are logged here instead of sent.'}")
	+if('data.provider === "missing"')
		Banner(variant="danger" icon="lucide:mail-x") The CMS requires an Aiosis Emails key. Set the AIOSIS_API_KEY secret (a key with the messages:send scope); until then sign-up, sign-in, notification and contact mail is refused and logged as failed.
	+if('data.log.length === 0')
		EmptyState(icon="lucide:mail" title="No mail yet")
	+else
		.space-y-2
			+each('data.log as m (m.id)')
				details.mail-item
					summary
						span.font-medium {m.subject}
						span.text-xs(class="text-fg-muted")  → {m.recipient} · {new Date(m.created_at).toLocaleString()}
						Badge(size="sm" variant!="{m.status === 'failed' ? 'danger' : (m.status === 'sent' ? 'success' : 'default')}") {m.status}
					+if('m.body')
						pre.mail-body {m.body}
					+if('m.error')
						p.text-sm.text-danger {m.error}

<script>
	{ data } := $props()
</script>
